## Test Plan

1. **Unit tests**: `cargo test` in `constellation-mesh/` — all 24 test cases pass
2. **Integration test**: Spin up 3-node mesh in Docker, verify event propagation
3. **Build test**: `pipeline-omega-rockchip/build.sh` produces signed ARM64 artifacts
4. **Device test**: Flash to Flipper One dev board, verify mesh daemon starts
5. **LLM test**: `aegentis_llm_bridge.py` connects to Groq API, returns intent-parse results
6. **CI test**: GitHub Actions cross-compilation + QEMU user-mode test suite

