## Performance Targets

| Metric | Target | Verified On |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| Mesh daemon binary size | <10MB | ROG Ally X |
| Mesh daemon RAM (idle) | <50MB | ROG Ally X |
| Event propagation latency | <100ms (local) | Localhost mesh |
| LLM inference (Groq) | ~1.76s for 560 tokens | Groq API live |
| LLM inference (local INT4) | <5s for 128 tokens | RK3566 sim |
| Build pipeline duration | <15 minutes | GitHub Actions |

---

## Backwards Compatibility

- Mesh daemon is opt-in — does not interfere with existing Linux userspace
- LLM container runs as unprivileged Podman container — no kernel modifications
- Build pipeline adds new targets without breaking existing `fbt` workflow
- Kernel module is loadable/unloadable — no permanent kernel changes

---

